  "description": "The WindOps regression set. 1.0 was M8.12's twelve investigations; 1.1 gave three scenarios variant seeds, so no held-out telemetry is replayed in another split (EVL-006); 1.2 adds 25 diagnosis scenarios (M12.3), so turbine fault diagnosis, gearbox diagnostics and vibration analysis have ten each.; 1.3 adds 38 planning scenarios (M12.4), so weather impact, production impact, maintenance planning and spare parts have ten each.; 1.4 adds 55 governance scenarios (M12.5), so safety escalation, tool selection, RAG grounding, RBAC and security, human approval and failure recovery have ten each, with a prompt-injection case for every tool that returns external content (MCP-008). Phase 12 grows it to 100 to 200.",
